# The feed refuses before it has ever answered.
#
# `cadence` refuses twice, but only after a board is already on screen, so the
# refusal is correctly ignored and the age keeps showing. The other case never
# appeared anywhere: a first attempt that fails, with nothing to keep.
#
# Then the status bar must name the failure, because there is no board to
# protect and silence would read as "no buses are running". A refusal that
# reached no further than the log would leave the app looking like a quiet
# Sunday on a morning the agency was down.
cache ../cache.db
date 2026-09-11
time 08:00
offset -04:00
size 100 14

feed fail http status: 503

type 1869
enter
